Application **26/01501/FUL** is for a change of use to a cafe at 9 Tannery Close. Its current status is **awaiting validation**, which means the council has received it but has not yet checked that it is complete and valid. Because of this, no consultation closing date or decision due date has been set yet.

As a neighbour, you will normally be notified once the application is validated and consultation begins. At that point you can submit comments, and the closing date will be published then. Until validation, there is no formal consultation period open, so comments submitted now may not be formally recorded.

If you'd like, I can check the planning constraints for 9 Tannery Close (for example, whether it is in a conservation area or is a listed building), which may be relevant to your comments. I can't give a view on whether the application should be approved; that decision will be made by the council once it has been assessed.
